  "notes": "{揃|そろ}う has two core meanings: (1) all members/items being present, and (2) things being uniform or aligned.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{揃|そろ}える→揃える：01952_soroeru⟧ (transitive, to arrange/gather)\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{揃|そろ}っている indicates a resulting state where everything is now complete or uniform.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{全員|ぜんいん}→全員：03310_zenin⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{揃|そろ}う: everyone gathers/is present\n- ⟦{道具|どうぐ}→道具：01479_dougu⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{揃|そろ}う: tools are complete\n- ⟦{意見|いけん}→意見：01303_iken⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{揃|そろ}う: opinions are aligned\n- ⟦サイズ→サイズ：01363_saizu⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{揃|そろ}っている: sizes are uniform\n- ⟦{息|いき}→息：02176_iki⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{揃|そろ}う: to be in sync\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦お{揃|そろ}い→お揃い：27779_osoroi⟧: matching (clothes, items)\n- ⟦{揃|そろ}い{踏|ぶ}み→揃い踏み：27778_soroibumi⟧: lineup, full cast appearing",
